```swift
private func isTagCharacter(_ c: Character) -> Bool {
    (c >= "a" && c <= "z") || (c >= "A" && c <= "Z") || (c >= "0" && c <= "9") ||
 c == "-" || c == "_"
}
```

This matches [A-Za-z0-9_-] exactly.

